# A `path:` URL to the flake's own directory: Nix copies only nix/ into the store, not the
# whole checkout with target/, and skips its Git detection, which a jj workspace without .git
# would turn into a copy of every file (.agents/wiki/parallel-workspaces.md).
watch_file nix/flake.nix nix/flake.lock
use flake "path:$PWD/nix"
